  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">BARNENS R&#xc4;TT I SAMH&#xc4;LLET SVERIGE CSO STRATEGI 2025-2029</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CHILDREN&#xb4;S RIGHTS IN SOCIETY SWEDEN CSO STRATEGY 2025&#x2013;2029 - UKRAINE CHILDREN&#xb4;S RIGHTS IN SOCIETY SWEDEN CSO STRATEGY 2025&#x2013;2029</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsens &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att st&#xf6;dja barn och unga genom att tillhandah&#xe5;lla st&#xf6;d via en st&#xf6;dlinje f&#xf6;r barn samt att bidra till f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrade levnadsvillkor f&#xf6;r barn genom att st&#xe4;rka civilsamh&#xe4;llesakt&#xf6;rer. Detta ska genomf&#xf6;ras i samarbete med totalt tre lokala civilsamh&#xe4;llesorganisationer, lokaliserade i Bosnien och Hercegovina, Zambia och Ukraina.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overarching objective of the intervention is to support children and young people by delivering support through a child helpline and by contributing to improved living conditions for children through the strengthening of civil society actors. The intervention will be implemented in collaboration with three local civil society organizations based in Bosnia and Herzegovina, Zambia, and Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
